Designed for committed intermediate to advanced skaters who want to progress over time in a small group setting (limited to 8 skaters per class) meeting 2 to 3 times a month.\
We'll cover elements such as edges, one foot spins, two foot spins, one leg sit spins, jumps, off skates spinner exercises, toe stop spins, and more!

Location:\
8 minutes walk from Holborn Station (Central Line) / 8 minutes walk from Russel Square (Piccadilly Line). No on site parking available
